  era: "6th\u20135th c. BCE \xB7 Section 4 \xB7 Religious Movements \xB7 6th \u2013 5th century BCE onwards"
  title: Other Shramana traditions
  text: Many wandering ascetics, the shramanas, questioned Vedic ritual. They included the Ajivikas led by Makkhali Gosala, who believed in fate, or niyati, and the materialist Charvaka or Lokayata school, which denied rebirth and the afterlife.
